---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About | Devtegra"
  description="Devtegra is a new software studio in Austin, Texas building mobile apps focused on user wellbeing, privacy, and long-term trust."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">About Devtegra</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      Devtegra is a new software studio based in Austin, Texas. Founded in 2026,
      we build mobile applications focused on user wellbeing, privacy, and long-term
      trust. That means no dark patterns, no data sales, no surprises: just products
      that work. Profit, when it comes, is a by-product of developing with integrity.
      Not the other way around.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Our first product</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      <a href="/fitcreature" class="font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:underline">FitCreature</a>,
      coming in 2026. Currently in development, FitCreature is a fitness app launching
      on the App Store and Google Play. More details will be shared closer to launch.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">How we build</h2>
    <ol class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-slate-600">
      <li>
        <strong class="text-slate-900">1. User-aligned monetization.</strong>
        We don't ship designs that push users toward unhealthy behavior for the sake of
        revenue. If it isn't good for the user, it doesn't earn its place in the product.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="text-slate-900">2. Data minimization.</strong>
        We collect what the product genuinely needs, not what we could collect. Sensitive
        content like progress photos stays on your device.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="text-slate-900">3. No dark patterns.</strong>
        No manufactured urgency, no hidden costs, no interfaces designed to trap you.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="text-slate-900">4. Transparency where it matters.</strong>
        How we handle your data, what we retain, and how you leave are all disclosed in
        plain English in our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Our team</h2>
    <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-slate-600">
      <li><strong class="text-slate-900">William</strong> &middot; Founder / Programmer</li>
      <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Morgan</strong> &middot; Artwork / Design</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
